WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.172 --> 00:00:02.361
NICK FURY
Heroes.

00:00:03.139 --> 00:00:04.822
It's an old-fashioned notion.

00:00:06.227 --> 00:00:09.651
No matter who wins or loses,
trouble still comes around.

00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:14.349
COBIE SMULDERS
Nick Fury is such a central character

00:00:14.399 --> 00:00:19.039
to this world. Like, his access to all of
these different Super Heroes,

00:00:19.089 --> 00:00:21.389
and the way that he's
seemingly all-knowing.

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:22.525
NICK FURY
I got my eye on you.

00:00:22.575 --> 00:00:24.043
KEVIN FEIGE
We always knew that Secret Invasion

00:00:24.093 --> 00:00:26.829
would first and
foremost focus on Nick Fury.

00:00:26.879 --> 00:00:30.711
And we really wanted to learn more about
him than we had ever learned before.

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:33.576
NICK FURY
This is my war. Alone.

00:00:33.627 --> 00:00:35.122
SAMUEL L. JACKSON
One of the things we talk about is

00:00:35.172 --> 00:00:42.216
Nick Fury is not a Super. His super-power
is his persuasiveness and fearlessness.

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:43.575
NICK FURY
I know the nature of this threat

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:45.597
way better than you ever will.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.902
ALI SELIM
After the Blip, Nick Fury really questions

00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:52.945
who he should trust. He's been on
S.A.B.E.R., and they bring him down.

00:00:53.007 --> 00:00:56.145
MARIA HILL
For years, you've been avoiding Earth.

00:00:56.195 --> 00:00:58.801
NICK FURY
Yeah, well, this is different.

00:00:58.851 --> 00:01:00.780
ALI SELIM
He's a Nick Fury that we've never seen

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:06.401
before. And so, that immediately
demands for a more grounded series.

00:01:07.157 --> 00:01:09.595
SAMUEL L. JACKSON
There's a real espionage element

00:01:09.645 --> 00:01:10.445
to what's going on.

00:01:10.495 --> 00:01:14.048
TALOS
Fury, we've got to be very careful now.

00:01:14.099 --> 00:01:15.278
DON CHEADLE
Hopefully, it'll feel like

00:01:15.328 --> 00:01:18.298
a different experience.
Something grittier.

00:01:18.349 --> 00:01:19.683
NICK FURY
An invasion is here,

00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:22.184
and we can't even tell
who the invaders are.

00:01:23.805 --> 00:01:25.255
DON CHEADLE
We get to really dig into Fury

00:01:25.305 --> 00:01:28.012
and the stakes that he's
having to encounter.

00:01:29.754 --> 00:01:30.677
G'IAH
This is just the beginning.

00:01:32.523 --> 00:01:35.187
NICK FURY
I'm the last person standing between them

00:01:36.953 --> 00:01:38.267
and what they really want.

